<title>SRI LANKA: TABLE-S.LANKA RICHARD 3-MTH NET UP 140 PC.</title>
<headline>TABLE-S.LANKA RICHARD 3-MTH NET UP 140 PC.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for three months ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>    Net profit	     57.07	vs	 23.73</p>
<p>    Turnover		499.89	vs	445.44</p>
<p>    Tax provision	   8.63	vs	  2.36</p>
<p>NOTE - Results are unaudited. The blue chip Richard Pieris &amp; Co Ltd markets household, industrial and agricultural products and manages plantations. The company consolidates accounts with Richard Pieris Exports Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
